  "description": "To Lord Vincent, his favorite servant, Adonis, has always appeared weak and fragile. This thought is further reinforced when Adonis becomes permanently injured in a horse-riding accident. In order to protect him, Vincent starts to keep his distance from Adonis, but that only triggers the servant to desire his master even more. Although the two of them can’t ride horses together anymore, with his whip in hand, Vincent might be willing to ride something else...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note:\n\\- Part of CNC Revolution's OOTD Danpyeonseon (OOTD 단편선) Collection.*\n*\\- Includes four extra chapters.*",
